Participation Schedule for Lionsgate Derivative Participation

Incorporate policy "lg-cleared@1".
Account for each calendar quarter.
Require Outside Hurdle Agreement == Agreement or fail "LG_HURDLE_WRONG_SCOPE".
Outside Hurdle Attained is the supplied outside hurdle attainment citing "LG-OUTSIDE-HURDLE".
Require Outside Hurdle Attained or fail "LG_OUTSIDE_HURDLE_NOT_ATTAINED".
Require Outside Hurdle Effective Date < Quarter Start or fail "LG_HURDLE_TIMING_POLICY_REQUIRED".
Require Gate History Picture == Picture Identifier or fail "LG_GATE_HISTORY_WRONG_WORK".
Require Gate History Start == Quarter Start and Gate History End == Quarter End or fail "LG_GATE_HISTORY_WRONG_PERIOD".
Work Cleared Throughout is the supplied continuous work gate evidence citing "LG-GATE-HISTORY".
Require Work Cleared Throughout or fail "LG_GATE_HISTORY_POLICY_REQUIRED".
Require Opening Gate Gross >= Opening Gate Cost or fail "LG_CROSSING_POLICY_REQUIRED".
Require Producer Fee Offset >= USD 0 or fail "LG_NEGATIVE_FEE_OFFSET".
Require Crossed Net Subtotal >= USD 0 or fail "LG_NET_LOSS_POLICY_REQUIRED".
Require Opening Payment Holdback >= USD 0 and Payment Holdback Addition >= USD 0 and Payment Holdback Release >= USD 0 or fail "SYNTHETIC_INVALID_HOLDBACK_MOVEMENT".

Current Cash Receipts are the receipts for this Picture received during the quarter.
Current Actual Costs are the actual costs for this Picture incurred during the quarter.
True Cash is the sum of current cash receipts citing "LG-TRUE-CASH".
Actual Cost is the sum of current actual costs citing "LG-TRUE-CASH-COST".
Next Gate Gross is Opening Gate Gross plus True Cash.
Next Gate Cost is Opening Gate Cost plus Actual Cost.
Require Next Gate Gross >= Next Gate Cost or fail "LG_RECROSSING_POLICY_REQUIRED".
Breakeven Satisfied is Next Gate Gross >= Next Gate Cost.
Gross Payout Base is the current receipts adjusted by the supplied video proxy citing "LG-GROSS-VIDEO-PROXY".
If Breakeven Satisfied:
  Gross Candidate is the greater of USD 0 and (Gross Participation Rate of Gross Payout Base less Producer Fee Offset) citing "LG-GROSS-BRANCH".
Otherwise:
  Gross Candidate is USD 0 citing "LG-GROSS-BRANCH".
Net Candidate is Net Participation Rate of Crossed Net Subtotal citing "LG-NET-BRANCH".
Contingent Earned Participation is the greater of Gross Candidate and Net Candidate citing "LG-GREATER-OF".
Selected Branch is if Gross Candidate == Net Candidate then "tie" else (if Gross Candidate > Net Candidate then "gross" else "net").

For settlement with the Participant:
  Before Payment Holdback is Contingent Earned Participation plus Payment Holdback Release.
  Require Payment Holdback Release <= Opening Payment Holdback or fail "SYNTHETIC_HOLDBACK_RELEASE_EXCEEDS_OPENING".
  Require Payment Holdback Addition <= Before Payment Holdback or fail "SYNTHETIC_HOLDBACK_ADDITION_EXCEEDS_AVAILABLE".
  Participation Payable is Before Payment Holdback less Payment Holdback Addition citing "SYNTHETIC-PAYMENT-HOLDBACK".
  Closing Gate Gross Balance is Next Gate Gross.
  Closing Gate Cost Balance is Next Gate Cost.
  Closing Payment Holdback Balance is Opening Payment Holdback plus Payment Holdback Addition less Payment Holdback Release.
  Report "comparison": True Cash, Gross Payout Base, Gross Candidate, Net Candidate, Selected Branch, Contingent Earned Participation, Outside Hurdle Evidence, Work Gate Evidence.
  Report "settlement": Agreement, Participant, Picture Identifier, Net Pool, Quarter, Contingent Earned Participation, Payment Holdback Addition, Payment Holdback Release, Participation Payable.

// Selected synthetic policies: cleared work throughout, prior-period outside
// hurdle attainment, gross-only fee offset and separate payment holdback.
Bindings:
  Schedule LionsgateDerivativePilot.
  Settle "the Participant" with policy.participant_id.
  Using language "spl/0.1-draft" core "spl-core/0.1-draft" schema "spl-data/0.1-draft".
  input receipts: List<LGReceipt>;
  input actual_costs: List<LGCost>;
  input policy: LGPolicy;
  input outside_hurdle: LGHurdleAttestation;
  input work_gate_history: LGGateHistoryAttestation;
  input crossed_net_subtotal: Money<USD>;
  input producer_fee_offset: Money<USD>;
  input payment_holdback_addition: Money<USD>;
  input payment_holdback_release: Money<USD>;
  opening gate_gross: Money<USD> from "lg/work-D/true-cash/cumulative-gross";
  opening gate_cost: Money<USD> from "lg/work-D/true-cash/cumulative-cost";
  opening payment_holdback: Money<USD> from "synthetic/work-D/payment-holdback";
  Bind "calendar quarter" to policy.period.
  Bind "Outside Hurdle Agreement" to outside_hurdle.agreement_id.
  Bind "Agreement" to policy.agreement_id.
  Bind "Outside Hurdle Attained" to outside_hurdle_attained.
  Bind "the supplied outside hurdle attainment" to outside_hurdle.attained.
  Bind "Outside Hurdle Effective Date" to outside_hurdle.effective_date.
  Bind "Quarter Start" to policy.period.start.
  Bind "Quarter End" to policy.period.end.
  Bind "Gate History Picture" to work_gate_history.asset_id.
  Bind "Picture Identifier" to policy.asset_id.
  Bind "Gate History Start" to work_gate_history.period.start.
  Bind "Gate History End" to work_gate_history.period.end.
  Bind "Work Cleared Throughout" to work_cleared_throughout.
  Bind "the supplied continuous work gate evidence" to work_gate_history.cleared_throughout.
  Bind "Opening Gate Gross" to gate_gross.
  Bind "Gate Gross Balance" to gate_gross.
  Bind "Opening Gate Cost" to gate_cost.
  Bind "Gate Cost Balance" to gate_cost.
  Bind "Producer Fee Offset" to producer_fee_offset.
  Bind "Crossed Net Subtotal" to crossed_net_subtotal.
  Bind "Opening Payment Holdback" to payment_holdback.
  Bind "Payment Holdback Balance" to payment_holdback.
  Bind "Payment Holdback Addition" to payment_holdback_addition.
  Bind "Payment Holdback Release" to payment_holdback_release.
  Bind "Current Cash Receipts" to current_receipts.
  Bind "the receipts for this Picture received during the quarter" to filter(receipts, r => r.asset_id == policy.asset_id and in_period(r.cash_received_date, accounting_period)).
  Bind "Current Actual Costs" to current_costs.
  Bind "the actual costs for this Picture incurred during the quarter" to filter(actual_costs, c => c.asset_id == policy.asset_id and in_period(c.incurred_date, accounting_period)).
  Bind "True Cash" to cash_measure.
  Bind "the sum of current cash receipts" to sum(current_receipts, r => r.amount).
  Bind "Actual Cost" to actual_cost_measure.
  Bind "the sum of current actual costs" to sum(current_costs, c => c.amount).
  Bind "Next Gate Gross" to next_gate_gross.
  Bind "Next Gate Cost" to next_gate_cost.
  Bind "Breakeven Satisfied" to breakeven_satisfied.
  Bind "Gross Payout Base" to payout_base.
  Bind "the current receipts adjusted by the supplied video proxy" to sum(current_receipts, r => r.amount * (if r.is_home_video then policy.video_proxy else 1)).
  Bind "Gross Candidate" to gross_candidate.
  Bind "Gross Participation Rate" to policy.gross_rate.
  Bind "Net Candidate" to net_candidate.
  Bind "Net Participation Rate" to policy.net_rate.
  Bind "Contingent Earned Participation" to contingent_earned.
  Bind "Selected Branch" to selected_label.
  Bind "Before Payment Holdback" to before_holdback.
  Bind "Participation Payable" to payable.
  Bind "Outside Hurdle Evidence" to outside_hurdle.
  Bind "Work Gate Evidence" to work_gate_history.
  Bind "Participant" to settlement_participant.
  Bind "Net Pool" to policy.pool_id.
  Bind "Quarter" to accounting_period.
  Field "True Cash" as cash_measure.
  Field "Gross Payout Base" as payout_base.
  Field "Gross Candidate" as gross_candidate.
  Field "Net Candidate" as net_candidate.
  Field "Selected Branch" as selected_label.
  Field "Contingent Earned Participation" as earned.
  Field "Outside Hurdle Evidence" as outside_hurdle.
  Field "Work Gate Evidence" as work_gate_history.
  Field "Agreement" as agreement_id.
  Field "Participant" as participant_id.
  Field "Picture Identifier" as asset_id.
  Field "Net Pool" as net_pool_id.
  Field "Quarter" as period.
  Field "Payment Holdback Addition" as payment_holdback_addition.
  Field "Payment Holdback Release" as payment_holdback_release.
  Field "Participation Payable" as payable.
